===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|slang}} An [[ungainly]], [[dull]] or [[stupid]] person; someone who is lazy, disrespectful and/or whose beliefs and philosophies clash with another.
# {{lb|en|slang}} A large, muscular, stupid man, especially an athlete.
#: {{synonyms|en|brute|jock}}
#: ''Gary was a hulking '''meathead''' who, when he wasn't playing football, was either hunting, fishing or getting drunk and rowdy in some topless bar.''
# {{lb|en|military|slang|Canadian}} A member of the {{w|Canadian Forces Military Police}}.

